  "methodology": [
    "Real Keycloak OIDC, authenticated server sessions, PostgreSQL source scans, typed canonical writes and read-back assertions. No mocked identity, API response or source service.",
    "CI projects execute with one worker, zero test retries/skips, and automatic trace/video/screenshots disabled to avoid recording login credentials. Explicit screenshots contain authenticated synthetic data only.",
    "Asset-type beforeAll/beforeEach/afterAll hooks read the actual X-RateLimit-Remaining and X-RateLimit-Reset. When fewer than 200 requests remain, they wait at most 61 seconds within a 75-second hook budget before proceeding. No failed mutation or assertion is retried and production limits remain enabled.",
    "Axe WCAG2A/2AA/2.1AA/2.2AA runs after finite animations settle, with no rule or element exclusions. Horizontal document overflow is checked at each captured width.",
